  <h3>DIS(H)covering nucleus-wise gene signal counts using self-supervised contrastive learning</h3>
  <p class="meta"><span class="venue">Under review, MICCAI 2026</span> &nbsp;·&nbsp; MIND Lab, IIT Ropar, in collaboration with Homi Bhabha Cancer Hospital (HBCH), Chandigarh &nbsp;·&nbsp; Prajapati, Mondal et al.</p>
